 wing left on each bird</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"mgr-grouse-trip:7\"><span>Species tally in the Journal</span></label></div><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: photo ID gallery and maps</summary><ul><li><a href=\"#/s/gallery-upland\">Photo ID gallery: grouse and more</a>.</li><li><a href=\"#/s/habitat-upland\">Habitat tour: quail and grouse</a>.</li><li><a href=\"#/map\">Hunt Map</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Field care step 4. A grouse in a cooler with ice, and a thermometer reading under 4 degrees Celsius. At home: fridge up to 3 days, freezer up to 6 months.\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Care 4: cold, fast</text>\n<rect x=\"80\" y=\"90\" width=\"240\" height=\"140\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#cfe0ef\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<rect x=\"70\" y=\"74\" width=\"260\" height=\"26\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/>\n<rect x=\"110\" y=\"190\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"170\" y=\"190\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"230\" y=\"190\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"280\" y=\"190\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(200 160) scale(0.7 0.7)\"><polygon points=\"-20,-6 -38,-20 -48,-12 -52,0 -48,8 -20,8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/><path d=\"M-40 -18 Q-50 -10 -48 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"15\" fill=\"#9a6b45\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"-14\" 