/10\">Region 2</a>, <a href=\"#/s/rb-region-8/10\">Region 8</a>, <a href=\"#/s/rb-licences-fees\">licences</a>, <a href=\"#/s/rb-where-you-can-hunt/17\">road allowance</a>. Synopsis 2 October 2026 edition <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://hgic.clemson.edu/factsheet/safe-handling-of-wild-game-birds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clemson Cooperative Extension, Safe handling of wild game birds</a>, read directly <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">80%</span>.</li><li>Extension services citing USDA game bird cooking temperature, search preview <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">80%</span>.</li><li>Meat yield: app quick lesson, Project Upland search preview <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span>.</li><li>Biology facts on the cheat sheet: sources in chapters 1 to 9.</li><li>All checked 2026-10-11. Full log: <code>research/2026-10-11-masterclass-grouse.md</code>.</li></ul></details>"]